[439.768044, "o", "\r\nBest: makespan=37, changes=1, shift=69\r\n    Job 0 Op 0: M1 [0-5]\r\n    Job 1 Op 0: M0 [0-5]\r\n  * Job 2 Op 0: M2 [0-6]\r\n    Job 3 Op 0: M0 [5-12]\r\n    Job 0 Op 1: M2 [6-12]\r\n    Job 0 Op 2: M0 [12-17]\r\n    Job 2 Op 1: M0 [17-25]\r\n    Job 1 Op 1: M1 [20-26]\r\n    Job 2 Op 2: M2 [25-30]\r\n    Job 1 Op 2: M0 [26-33]\r\n    Job 3 Op 1: M1 [26-31]\r\n    Job 3 Op 2: M2 [31-37]\r\n"]
